1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
一碗面，靠五个字火遍全国
One bowl, five words, nationwide fame

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
一清·二白·三红·四绿·五黄
Clear, white, red, green, yellow

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
汤要清，萝卜要白
Broth clear, radish white,

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
辣油红，香菜蒜苗绿
chili oil red, herbs green,

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
面条黄亮，这才算一碗
noodles bright yellow — then it's real

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
1915年，马保子创出这碗面
In 1915, Ma Baozi created it

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
师傅手一抖，分出九种粗细
One pull — nine noodle widths

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
毛细·细·二细·三细·韭叶
Hair-thin, thin, second, third, leek-leaf,

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
宽·大宽，随你一句话
wide, extra-wide — just say the word

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
兰州人只叫它「牛肉面」
Locals just call it "beef noodles"

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,200
不叫拉面，这是规矩
Not "lamian" — that's the rule

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,400
你点毛细，还是二细？
Hair-thin, or second-thin — which?

13
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:28,800
下集：一只砂锅，统治写字楼
Next: one clay pot rules the office
